## Node name — override with RELX_NODENAME env var in Docker
-name clexical@127.0.0.1

## Cookie — override with RELX_COOKIE env var
-setcookie clexical_secret

## Increase port range for distribution
-kernel inet_dist_listen_min 9100
-kernel inet_dist_listen_max 9200

## Async threads
+A 16

## Scheduler threads = number of online CPUs
+S 0:0

## Enable SMP
-smp enable

## Heap configuration
+hms 4096

## Max number of processes
+P 1048576

## Enable time-corrected clock
+c true
